    'EN6-01-A: Six legal creatures are selected. Two succeed on WIS, one fails but is Charmed-immune, and three acquire independent Charmed relations toward the Wizard. The paid 13 RP is not reduced and none of the unavailable selections is reassigned. One of the three succeeds at its next regular END and ends only its own relation; the other two retain their original minute deadlines.',
